# prompt: short harsh error buzz for a rejected action
# tags: ui, error, deny, buzz
# A minor second between the two squares, kept deliberately: the beating between
# 220 and 233 Hz is what the ear reads as "wrong", and the waveshaper only makes
# that reading louder.
sound "ui error" 100ms ui
  buzz: tone square ~220Hz[140..340] >> dist drive ~3[1..8] mix 0.6 | gain 0.26 decay 90ms
  beat: tone square ~233Hz[150..360] | gain 0.2 decay 85ms delay 6ms
